          "category": "general",
          "text": "Rizin is a UNIX-like reverse engineering framework and command-line toolset. Prior to 0.8.2, a heap overflow can be exploited when a malicious mach0 file, having bogus entries for the dyld chained segments, is parsed by rizin. This vulnerability is fixed in 0.8.2.",
